            "name": "预设爬塔",
            "entry": "星塔_入口_agent",
            "description": "严格按队伍预设抓取潜能(需手动导入对应队伍分享码)。<br><b>分享码：</b><br>水队(千/苍/薇洛) AAAAkAAAAIIAAACgMAZLZADNgEBsADAGwGwG<br>暗队(花/乙/珂) AAAAnQAAAJEAAACOzbALADDNkBsAAGyAwAww<br>光队(希/火/缇) AAAAmwAAAHMAAABrzbAABYIwBsNsAMwWAGAG<br>火队(冬/菈/紫) AAAAhgAAAJ4AAAB+MAbDADbCABgMBsw2GAGA",
            "option": [
